    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d104">

                <pb facs="0272" n="176" xml:id="pg176"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sansón to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>
                            <placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#small-caps">National
                                Palace</hi></placeName>, <placeName type="city"><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-12-05"><hi rendition="#italic">December
                                5, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have the honor herewith to
                    transmit to your excellency the autograph letter which is addressed by His
                    Excellency General President Zelaya to His Excellency the President of the
                    United States of America, informing him of the political change which took place
                    in Nicaragua on the 1st instant.</p>
                <p>Begging your excellency to forward the autograph letter in question to its high
                    destination, I offer you the assurance of my most distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <p>Your excellency’s faithful and obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Sansón.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d104-a1.xml" xpointer="d104-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
